# .mailmap file for mapping author names and emails
#
# This file allows Git to map different names/emails to the same person
# Format: Proper Name <proper@email.com> Other Name <other@email.com>
#
# Example:
# John Doe <john@example.com> John <john@example.com>
# John Doe <john@example.com> john.doe <john.doe@example.com>
